Rock!

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:54.790
Paper!

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.080
By the way, I couldn't decide between
this outfit and that one.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:02.370
Thank goodness you chose this one.

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:06.700
Still, Tada-senpai is the only one who can pull
that off! He looks good in everything!

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:10.370
I'm going to take a commemorative picture!
Please look this way!

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:12.830
Senpai, you're so scary!

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:14.450
Smile, smile!

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:18.660
Woo! You're scary cool!

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:21.410
Will I be able to leave some sort of lasting
impression on HINA with this?

00:15:21.410 --> 00:15:23.950
Come on! You better hurry or you're gonna be late!

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:26.160
HINA
1st Photo Collection
Book Launch
Official Goods On Sale

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:25.950
Okay. Then...

00:15:26.160 --> 00:15:28.160
HINA Photo Collection
Non-standard A4 Size, 128 pages / 2,500 yen
TSUCHIYA BOOKS

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:30.250
I-I'll be back!

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:32.040
Today's recommendation!

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:32.040
Mystery!!

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:37.250
You know, when you look at her from here,
doesn't HINA look like someone?

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:38.450
You think so?

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:39.500
Who does she look like?

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:42.080
Uh... I'm not sure who she looks like...

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:05.410
Still... I wish he'd show interest in the real me, if possible.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:10.120
I think HINA-san is a part of the real you, Hasegawa-san.

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:15.910
HINA-san, it's time.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:18.540
Okay!

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:26.200
Hajime-chan, I've made up my mind.
I'll meet you properly, face-to-face.

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:30.660
GUIDE

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:32.200
I'll always be a fan of yours! Please do your best!

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:36.660
HINA
Photo Collection Book Launch MEET & GREET

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:33.910
Thank you so much.

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:35.370
Okay, time's up.

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:36.700
I'll come by again!

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:38.700
Next person in line, step right up!

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:38.120
See you later!

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:51.290
Did you notice that it's me, Hajime-chan?

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:54.910
C-calm down... Deep breaths.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:02.410
I-I had made note of the important things.

00:17:03.580 --> 00:17:06.620
Ugh! It's not there! It's not there!

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:09.700
The things I was going to say went missing!

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:15.410
Thank you for always supporting me!

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:21.040
R-right!

00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:28.750
Calm down!

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:33.000
What do you do when you can't help but feel nervous?

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:34.500
What...?

00:17:34.790 --> 00:17:39.830
When you can't help but feel nervous,
write the character for "person," then swallow it.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:42.700
I really think that will work best.

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:54.330
Did you realize who I am, Hajime-chan?

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:03.200
Okay, time's up.

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:06.450
What? W-wait, I haven't said any...

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:08.500
Ah!

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:17.500
Th-thank you for being born! Really, thank you!

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:16.330
O-kay!

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:19.660
The exit is that way!

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:21.410
Thank you! Thank you!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:26.620
"For being born"? What?

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:36.040
Tada Coffee Shop

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:36.080
Thank you for today, my friends!

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:39.410
Thanks to all of you, I was able to tell HINA my feelings!

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:41.080
I even squeezed her hands!

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:42.540
For real?!

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:43.750
Wow!

00:18:43.750 --> 00:18:45.700
I won't ever wash my hands again!

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:46.830
What?! That's gross!

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:49.000
So, what did you say to her?

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:50.330
That's a secret!

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:52.700
What?! Please do tell!

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:54.540
I wanna know! I wanna know!

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:58.910
HINA-san,
Thank you for being born!
Really, thank you!!

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:02.200
I'll pretend I didn't see this.

00:19:02.200 --> 00:19:07.830
So, this day has become an anniversary for the day
that HINA and I had our fateful encounter!

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:10.250
Well, there are misunderstandings when you're in love.

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:11.750
It's not a misunderstanding!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:15.120
"Love is a house of mirrors. It's an illusion."

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:20.830
That's Yoshiko Yamamura Poiron's famous line from
"Sunflower Express: A Police Blotter in Love" volume 5!

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:21.750
Yes!

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:23.500
It's not at all an illusion!

00:19:23.450 --> 00:19:27.450
Tada Coffee Shop

00:19:24.790 --> 00:19:26.910
Are you mad? Are you mad, Senpai?

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:34.080
Hajime-chan

00:19:32.700 --> 00:19:33.950
Hajime-chan?!

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:36.410
Hello?

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:37.250
Hey.

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:39.830
Hey... What's up?

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:44.000
I mean, what an amazingly beautiful girl...

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:47.540
You were amazing.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:48.410
What?!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:53.540
When I wrote "person" on my hand like you told me to,
everything worked out fine.

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:58.290
I see...

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:01.330
Did you get to say everything you wanted to say?

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:05.540
Yeah, and, um...

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.040
Thank you.

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:21.620
Hinako
Call Ended

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:24.790
You there!

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:27.000
Could you come with us?

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:32.700
It seems Hajime-chan didn't realize it was me after all.

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:35.620
But I think, for now, this is for the best.

00:20:35.620 --> 00:20:40.700
"If you like him, then you must explicitly tell him!
Men are obtuse, no matter where you go."

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:43.330
That's what it said in "Sunflower Express"!

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:49.580
Are you okay with him never realizing that it's you?

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:51.580
Good point...

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:57.500
But I'll tell him once I have a bit
more confidence in myself.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.830
I want to save what's important for last.

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:05.330
Okay!

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:13.120
The day that Pin-senpai learns
the truth will come eventually, huh?

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.450
Is something the matter?

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:20.750
I was just thinking about how
I didn't tell everyone the truth.

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:24.450
What good would it do to tell them?

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:27.910
One day, we'll be saying goodbye,
once our study abroad is over.

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:29.080
That's true.

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:35.790
Love is a complicated thing, huh?
You feel joy, pain, and sorrow...

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:39.830
Have you ever fallen in love, Alec?

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:41.950
Well... no, never.

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:44.120
You have, haven't you?

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:45.410
No, I have not.

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:46.910
Have you smiled so far?

00:21:46.910 --> 00:21:48.120
I have not!

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:49.000
Oh!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:52.000
I never have!

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:56.000
Honestly, Miss Teresa, I mean it!

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:12.580
Itsumademo tsuzuite yuku to, boku wa zutto omottetan da yo

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:23.830
Ano hi kimi ga kirei sugiru wake o, boku wa nani mo shiranakatta

00:22:24.750 --> 00:22:30.080
Kamisama tte hito ga kimi o tsuresatte

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:36.040
Ni-do to wa aenai to boku ni iu

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:41.660
Doko ni ikun da yo, boku wa nani mo dekinakatta yo

00:22:41.660 --> 00:22:46.660
Utsukushi sugita hito yo

00:22:47.620 --> 00:22:53.160
Aitakute, aitakute donna kimi demo

00:22:53.410 --> 00:22:58.790
Negaigoto ga moshi hitotsu kanau naraba

00:22:59.160 --> 00:23:04.750
Imasugu ni, imasugu ni dakishimetain da yo

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:10.370
Zutto kimi no soba ni dake itakattan da

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:15.580
Kokoro no naka wa namida no ame no melody

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:24.250
Kimi to sugoshita hibi wa wasureru nante dekinain da yo

00:23:26.830 --> 00:23:28.500
Alec, what month were your born in?

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:29.330
September.

00:23:29.330 --> 00:23:30.410
So, you're a Virgo?!

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:31.080
I suppose.

00:23:31.080 --> 00:23:32.620
Then, do you believe in ghosts?

00:23:32.620 --> 00:23:33.660
I don't know.

00:23:33.660 --> 00:23:36.500
Next time: Episode 5, "It's Okay. They Don't Exist."

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:41.000
It's Okay. They Don't Exist

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:38.700
Even if you tell me that, you have zero persuasive power.

00:23:38.700 --> 00:23:39.660
How so?!

00:23:39.660 --> 00:23:40.790
Please look forward to it!
